WEBVTT

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.110
It's cold...

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.560
Kotonoha...

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.680
Makoto...

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.780
I can't right now!

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:10.100
Why not?! The food's already ready.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.620
I'll have to heat it up again!

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.650
I told you, you can just go ahead and eat it with out me.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.510
You don't understand at all!

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:25.770
I made it because I wanted to eat with you.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.970
Yeah, but...

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.640
Makoto...

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.680
Are you that worried about my cooking?

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:41.490
That's not it.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:42.850
Then what is it?!

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.990
Why aren't you coming home?

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:48.740
I told you something came up that I can't get away from right now.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:50.590
You're lying.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:51.710
Huh?

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.830
Who are you with right now?

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:55.590
I'm not really seeing anyone.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.120
You're planning on cheating on me again?

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:01.100
No! I'm having a lot of issues over here.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.600
And I'm asking you to explain it!

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.270
That's...

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.110
See, you can't even say it.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.720
Please think about the situation you're in.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:15.520
You don't understand anything at all.

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:22.460
I'm carrying your baby inside me.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.920
Kotonoha wouldn't say something like that.

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:31.960
Wh-What? Why did you say Katsura-san's name just now?!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.090
Makoto...

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.030
You're not with her, are you?

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.960
Is Katsura-san with you?

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.310
Makoto!

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.910
Why did you get pregnant?!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.580
Why did you have to say that in front of everyone?!

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.540
Like I would know what to do if someone told me they were pregnant all of a sudden!

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.820
M-Makoto, wait-

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:01.910
Just go home! Don't stay at my house like you're my girlfriend or something!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.880
Damn it!

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.900
1 Item
From: Saionji Sekai
Subject: I'm sorry
I'm going home for today

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.070
Motehara-Sakashita. Motehara-Sakashita.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.500
Wait here.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.050
I'll get you some tea.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:48.380
Because she wanted to eat with me...huh?

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.260
I was satisfied at first just looking at her...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:05:01.110
I'd get nervous just sitting next to her eating lunch.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:07.350
I wonder when I started getting the feeling that I wanted to touch her, to hold her...

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:14.360
I started not being able to hold back.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:17.350
I kept telling myself I wanted more.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.780
I was being selfish.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:27.790
Ouch.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:42.840
Huh?

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.730
Why is Katsura-san here?!

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:53.880
Sekai, why are you-?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.010
That doesn't matter! Why are you with Katsura-san?!

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.960
Th-That's...

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:00.800
Go home!

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:04.580
Please, don't follow Makoto around anymore!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.330
That's not it, Sekai!

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.290
What's not what?!

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.930
Didn't you break up with Katsura-san?!

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:14.590
Since I got pregnant, you're just going to toss me by the wayside?!

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:15.740
That's...

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:19.600
I thought you didn't like Katsura-san anymore!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.320
I...

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.600
You didn't invite her here, did you?

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:27.570
Katsura-san did something, right?

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.470
Kotonoha...

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:31.370
...didn't...

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.490
Liar!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.190
You asked Makoto out, didn't you?

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:37.590
Get out!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:38.660
I said get out!

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:46.120
Aren't you the one who seduced Makoto-kun?

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:47.790
Kotonoha...

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:54.660
You did all of those things to get me away from Makoto-kun...

00:06:54.920 --> 00:07:01.440
No! Makoto and I love each other. We felt the same for each other.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.720
That's what you wanted to think.

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:12.080
You're the one who asked Kiyoura-san to do all of that.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.630
Setsuna? Setsuna did something?

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:18.560
What do you mean "asked?"

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:24.360
Oh, I see. You didn't know, Saionji-san?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.580
Know what?

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:32.600
Kiyoura-san also likes Makoto.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:42.020
She wasn't trying to get me to give up on him. Kiyoura really liked him.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.560
Stop spouting bullshit.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:51.780
Setsuna's...m-my best friend.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:57.110
I may not look like it, but I'm quite kind.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.790
I'll forgive you for what you've done.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:10.580
You told me that Makoto-kun actually cares about me a lot.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:18.710
So, you said I have to think about how Makoto-kun feels, too.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:22.310
Why bring that up now...?

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.360
I finally understand.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:28.910
Makoto-kun's always been by my side waiting for me.

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:32.610
Kotonoha...

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.320
So...

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.720
I won't waiver anymore.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.700
Stop it!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.380
I said stop it!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:21.640
No!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.080
Here's the information about him.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.920
His name is Itou Makoto.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.420
I know that.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:45.360
His birthday is October 16. His blood type is O.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.480
It doesn't really matter that much.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:54.280
But it's such a romantic way to meet, to be saved during the orientation. Maybe he even likes you.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:10:03.440
I asked around some more, but it sounds like he's a really nice guy. He's got a pretty good reputation.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:05.370
Yeah.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.670
I got a picture, too.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.390
I'll send it to you, too, Setsuna.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.060
Even so...

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:26.270
Even so, you started to want the flower you intended to give to someone else.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:34.370
And when it came to him, you wanted him to praise you, so you gave him the flower.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.420
No.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.080
I'm such a good girl for finding such a pretty flower, right?

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.570
Let me show you how to pick this flower.

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:49.540
You pretended to be nice to make yourself look better.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.430
No!

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:53.860
You used the flower as an excuse to get closer to him...

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:55.670
You're a hypocrite.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:56.930
You're wrong...

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:00.440
No, that's not what I meant to do!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:03.440
Then why did you do that?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:14.230
Besides, if you had never sat next to him...

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:19.160
If you had never introduced him to Katsura-san...

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:23.980
This might not have happened.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.340
No!

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:42.190
No...  Makoto told me he was fine with it...

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:44.980
He said he liked me. He said didn't want to be with anyone else.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.000
He said he liked me!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:50.810
See you later.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.870
Yeah, good night.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.990
Yeah.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:16.040
Makoto!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:29.380
1 Item
From: Itou Makoto
Kotonoha said she would introduce you to a clinic she knows. The sooner you go, the less stress on your body.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:37.120
clinic

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:09.650
1 Item
From: Saionji Sekai
I want to talk to you. I'll go to your house. Just the two of us.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.350
I see.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.500
So Saionji-san is going to go to the clinic?

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.600
Yeah, probably.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:23.220
This is all thanks to you.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.740
Oh, not at all.

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.530
This is really good!

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:36.930
You made this special, didn't you?

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:39.930
Yeah, I learned it from my mother.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:46.050
I want to keep spending time with you like this.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:54.240
I'm a pushover, and I really think I did you wrong, but...

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.690
From now on, I'll stay focused on you.

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:00.650
Makoto-kun!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.510
Well, sit down...

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.320
So how was it?

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.450
I'll get you some tea-

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.560
I'll get it.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:04.860
I guess Sekai was just imagining things.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.450
So you're going to make him dinner?

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:45.060
Yeah.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.070
You're going to stay there and then go to the ocean the next day?

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.660
That sounds fun!

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.250
I want to go, too!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.510
Jeez...

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:56.030
Sounds fun!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.060
1 Item
From: Saionji Sekai
Sorry

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.120
Sekai?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:15.200
Goodbye.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.170
You're too cruel!

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:39.730
You're trying to be happy with Katsura-san!

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.410
Se...kai...

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:41.810
1 Item
From: Itou Makoto
I'll be waiting on the roof.

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.940
Did you go to the clinic?

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:13.050
He's a good doctor.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:16.140
I didn't go.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.500
Why?

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.500
There's no way I'd go to a clinic you'd recommend!

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:24.740
It's because you're lying.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:31.480
You lied saying you had a baby to try and get Makoto-kun.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.550
I didn't!

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:34.550
How so?

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.550
I'm really pregnant!

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:40.420
Then you should be able to show that at the clinic.

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:47.610
Besides, there's no way you'd be able to carry his child.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:53.780
Because I'm Makoto-kun's girlfriend.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:55.810
Am I wrong?

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.020
I...

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.680
I wanted to be Makoto's girlfriend, too!

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:06.990
I just held it in and did everything he wanted me to!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.150
Why?! How did this happen?!

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:14.220
Makoto-kun's...

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.790
Makoto-kun's right there.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.170
Why don't you try asking him?

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.620
Let me see...

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:02.140
...whether or not you're telling the truth.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:44.150
Just as I thought...

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:47.720
You were lying.

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:53.320
There's no baby inside of you.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.440
We can finally be alone, Makoto-kun.

00:24:12.620 --> 00:24:17.530
It at was the start of second semester when I noticed that she took the same train as me.

00:24:19.070 --> 00:24:22.370
All I knew about her was that she was part of the class next door.

00:24:23.640 --> 00:24:27.380
She seemed to like books and was always reading them on the train to and from home.

00:24:28.610 --> 00:24:34.290
Nothing was originally supposed to come out of me noticing that we took the same train, but...

00:24:35.880 --> 00:24:40.890
It was just sort of like I could gaze at her... Gaze at Katsura Kotonoha from afar.

00:24:41.810 --> 00:24:46.470
And one day, I just sort of felt like I wanted a bit more.
